(Los Angeles, CA.) April 28, 2017 - Anjali returns with a fresh new track entitled "Uh Oh". The Bay Area native captures the essence of Lumidee's 2003 "Never Leave You". The vibin track produced by Super Dave gets a boost with a hot feature from LA's own Casey Veggies. Anjali gets her stripes from working with mega artists such as French Montana, Tyga, Iamsu, and countless other Bay Area artists.

